    <tags>tachyon music player audio crossfade crossfeed equalizer reverb dsp lyrics flac mp3 foss</tags>
    <summary>Ultra-fast, lightweight modern music player with continuous crossfade and advanced DSP audio effects.</summary>
    <description>
      Meet Tachyon, an ultra-fast, modern, and lightweight open-source music player designed for audiophiles and power users who demand high fidelity, fluid performance, and an elegant Material 3 interface.

      Key Features:
      - Ultra-Low Resource Usage: Built-in minimized mode suspends rendering, purges graphics memory, and throttles background timers, consuming less than 0.8% CPU and less than 10MB RAM during playback on Windows.
      - High-Fidelity Audio Engine: Seamless continuous 25ms crossfade with Equal-Power and Linear curves, true gapless playback, and volume boost up to 200%.
      - Studio-Grade DSP Effects: Real-time 10-band equalizer, Bauer Crossfeed (bs2b) for natural, fatigue-free headphone listening, stereo widener / spatializer, Freeverb algorithmic reverb with customizable room acoustics, true-peak limiter, pitch shifting, and variable speed control (0.5x–1.5x).
      - In-Memory Relational Graph: Instantaneous O(1) library navigation powered by a unified relational graph (LibraryStore) with zero UI jank and pure Dart isolate metadata extraction.
      - Synchronized Lyrics: Hierarchical multi-source lyrics resolution (embedded tags, local .lrc files, LRCLIB, and lyrics.ovh) with real-time O(log n) scrolling, tap-to-seek, and automated translation.
      - Modern Adaptive UI: Material 3 design with dynamic color schemes, pure OLED dark mode, responsive layout, and complete multi-language support (i18n).
      - Privacy-Focused &amp; 100% FOSS: Completely offline-first with zero telemetry, zero analytics, and no ads.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/chomusuke-mk/tachyon/releases/latest</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>